      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365774894104711439",
      "texto_sha256": "7865ea18d4366b9e42c4b5a88a0deba9d4eb9b55207b257bb2bf90545a55eaf5",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365775154353016904",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:42:51.673000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "**Sientes una presencia que te observa desde una de las tiendas del campamento**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "7f8e98ae29f9440ebfd95f6054aed6176d4bdb63f63f39dda0693d8c41353a4f",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365774894104711439",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365775154353016904",
      "texto_sha256": "5db8cf69b76fc2d05338a049d82919f9e98d8108f6a1d3e3be99f9d53494b99b",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365775393289932991",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:43:48.640000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Khora:\n**Al notar esa mirada me fijo a ver si veo quien me mira**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "76513436dae96476d8602b9c6fac548b109c507dd374f5841c5076bcdff5fb95",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365775154353016904",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365775393289932991",
      "texto_sha256": "b0024774a2506edc0741c66fe7fc8ed09bd61f675af04a44519ca39da79b564a",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365775536034549761",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:44:22.673000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "**Ves unos ojos verdes brillantes que te miran como si fueras una presa**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "3225ee359fd051a23b73bdc0b6c44a6b76641884621cc879228063c77714d95c",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365775393289932991",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365775536034549761",
      "texto_sha256": "7a511e841847d150f7c1ba8c3aa80580dc9d1ad85366f92bf96df7e2156e5c26",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365776127578210335",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:46:43.708000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Khora:\n**Mira esos ojos verdes altamente reconocibles**\nQuieres comida mi niña?",
      "mensaje_sha256": "972f2343af32c9c232c7efe3bfd79a865bfe419d03859a2f498e9eb6bdc56c0f",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365776127578210335",
      "texto_sha256": "6da9a50f27666ba71b14285f5ca41f84f51a8cee62a26bab6d0f9b2269eedbf6",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365778442934550639",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:55:55.732000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Arwen: KHORAAAAAAA **Va corriendo a tus brazos**",
