      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:57:39.361000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Khora:\n**Te coge en brazos y revisa a ver cuan sucia estás**\nTienes hambre?",
      "mensaje_sha256": "dbf239a30046a3f4b092decf5b1009812c267c8f7a1602981e97fba0023c99e2",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365778442934550639",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365778877586079795",
      "texto_sha256": "6151ad851f06fcb96ca79004e80b2794fdf2248c817e61eb5581f8525fb1d26c",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365778982632558743",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T19:58:04.406000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Arwen: si si si si **Asiente energica**",
