      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T21:22:07.385000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Samurai: **Te mira extrañado** ¿No lo has notado? Ha ocurrido hace un momento...",
      "mensaje_sha256": "fca6fb8bc532600dfc2c1cc46886429f81390ca31103a466b5866c343186f48a",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365799221785002005",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365800134419419266",
      "texto_sha256": "e0d3c94733f2b1b768e0b3d11330b7f35d5f591fd2d28e9b6b00adcc3ad8b00c",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1365800339810418820",
      "fecha_utc": "2025-04-26T21:22:56.354000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2025-04-26",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Jhin: si pero no se si era algo normal de la zona aunque soy un cazador no conozco demasiado este sitio",
      "mensaje_sha256": "c536495bab06b42b9c8f3a2559345ed9fbd1b7746f989b7c8815c589727c0c58",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1365800134419419266",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1362468595212488835/1365800339810418820",
